  m_Name: GItem_FarmBox
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_farmbox
  displayName: Large Farm Plot Box
  description: Ship-mounted floor farm. A 3x3 bed in one hull cell that grows nine
    food crops or one standing tree (planting a sapling claims the whole bed and
    locks the other eight cells until felled). Starts dry (0 L); needs grid power,
    water through a liquid port (or hand canister), and breathable air. Crops pause
    without air instead of dying, and ripe harvests move into connected grid cargo.
